title: Reveal on the canvas takes the file in front out of the tabs' view and flies the canvas to its card, the tab stays in the bar
folders: rust-small
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: tabs: \[.*steps\.rs\], in front: Some\(0\)
expect-log: tabs: \[.*steps\.rs\], in front: None

wait 3000
tab open src/steps.rs
wait 1000
mark in-the-tab
wait 450
tab report
tab reveal
wait 2000
mark revealed-on-the-canvas
wait 450
tab report
where
quit
